msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"That beautiful woman has to work here, no doubt about it.\r\n"
"But that means she works at a..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hey, kid, what're you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Sorry! I just, um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr "Qualcosa non va?"

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Hey! You're the guy from the burger joint!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "What burger joint?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Remember? You said you'd help me get a date with that girl\r\n"
"who worked at the burger shop, but it was a total bust!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Oh right, I remember you. You're the one who was practically\r\n"
"orbiting that hamburger place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"You sure have changed a lot, though. I never would've figured you were the "
"same guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"I fell in love with her way before you came along, but\r\n"
"because I asked for your help, she turned me down! *sniffle*\r\n"
"I really liked her, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"What burger joint? Oh, you're that kid from back then...\r\n"
"Talk about a makeover. You look completely different."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "So, how'd your date go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"We went out once, but she never picked up the phone after\r\n"
"that... She won't even reply to my texts..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Wait, so she dumped you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"No, she couldn't have! There's gotta be a good reason why\r\n"
"she hasn't responded to me! Maybe her dad got in a car\r\n"
"accident, or something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Fine, fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "This sucks... I really liked her, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"So... What're you doing now? Kids like you shouldn't be\r\n"
"hanging around places like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"I know, but... I just saw this incredibly beautiful woman\r\n"
"go into that club. I wanted to see if I could talk to her..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Come on, kid... Don't tell me you've fallen for a bonafide hostess now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"She looked so gorgeous, just like a movie star! There's\r\n"
"something about her that the girls in my class just don't have...\r\n"
"Mature feminine charm! That's gotta be it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"That's why I changed up my outfit, look a bit more grown up.\r\n"
"Be a real man worthy of a real woman like her. What do you\r\n"
"think? I got this getup from that store over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Is that how it is? I mean, you don't look too bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"She's older... so maybe she can teach me all sorts of things\r\n"
"about romance! Or maybe just even about... adult stuff..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Does it matter? In any case, you shouldn't block the\r\n"
"entrance of the club. You'll only cause trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"I guess you've got a point. I wouldn't want to make trouble\r\n"
"for that beautiful woman, anyway. I'll wait on the other\r\n"
"side!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Good grief."
msgstr ""

